## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical RHCSA skills: containerized TLS termination, dynamic config reload without downtime, per-tenant traffic controls, DNS-based service discovery, and health-check-driven failover.

## Key Concepts
- Podman container lifecycle and TLS termination
- Systemd Path units for zero-downtime reloads
- JSON-based per-tenant rate limiting mounted into the container
- DNS SRV discovery for backend pools and health checks
- Rollout testing: rollback paths and observability hooks

